{{ 'ssm-philosophy.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<div class="sp-root" data-sensol-philosophy>
  <section class="sp-hero">
    <div class="sp-hero-copy">
      <p class="sp-kicker">SENSOL / OUR PHILOSOPHY</p>
      <h1>Make room<br>for <em>you.</em></h1>
      <div class="sp-hero-bottom"><p>Movement belongs in everyday life.<br>In your space. At your pace. On your terms.</p><a class="sp-round" href="#PhilosophyBelief" aria-label="Discover our philosophy">↓</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="sp-hero-photo"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kowork9527/sensol-fitness-au/9f7ca6a3e1e728e59e9459f0db7e5369de3ce83b/images/8ef2abfd609fc805.webp" width="977" height="1302" fetchpriority="high" alt="A SENSOL FLEX AIR practice with hand straps"><figcaption>A PRACTICE OF YOUR OWN / SENSOL</figcaption></figure>
    <div class="sp-scroll-line" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="sp-belief sp-pad" id="PhilosophyBelief">
    <p class="sp-kicker">01 / WHAT WE BELIEVE</p>
    <h2 data-sp-manifesto>Movement is personal.<br>Make it part of your everyday.</h2>
    <div class="sp-belief-note"><span class="sp-small">MAKE IT EASY. DO IT REAL.</span><p>Some days you reach for strength. Other days, a slower stretch. We believe there should be room for both. SENSOL brings Pilates reformers into the places you live, so you can build a practice that feels like your own.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="sp-principles sp-pad" id="PhilosophyPrinciples">
    <header class="sp-section-head"><p class="sp-kicker">02 / THE THINKING BEHIND THE DESIGN</p><h2>Made for movement.<br>Considered for life.</h2></header>
    <div class="sp-principle-grid">
      <figure class="sp-principle-photo"><img data-sp-principle-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kowork9527/sensol-fitness-au/9f7ca6a3e1e728e59e9459f0db7e5369de3ce83b/images/7418f38cf3396353.webp" width="2832" height="3792" loading="lazy" alt="FLEX AIR practice in a warm home interior"><figcaption data-sp-caption>01 / A PLACE IN YOUR EVERYDAY</figcaption></figure>
      <div class="sp-accordion">
        <details open data-sp-principle="0"><summary><span>01</span><h3>A place in your everyday.</h3><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></summary><div class="sp-answer"><p>A reformer is part of your home as well as your practice. Proportion, finishes and a clear sense of space matter. Choose the footprint that works for your room, and leave space to move.</p><a href="/pages/engineering#EngineeringDimensions">Explore the footprints ↗</a></div></details>
        <details data-sp-principle="1"><summary><span>02</span><h3>Your way to move.</h3><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></summary><div class="sp-answer"><p>FLEX AIR pairs mechanical spring resistance with a sliding carriage. Configure the springs manually and explore controlled movement at your own pace. Follow the supplied manual and appropriate guidance for your practice.</p><a href="/pages/engineering#EngineeringSystems">Explore spring resistance ↗</a></div></details>
        <details data-sp-principle="2"><summary><span>03</span><h3>Details with a purpose.</h3><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></summary><div class="sp-answer"><p>The rail, carriage and supporting parts each have a job to do. We want you to understand what you are choosing: how it works, what comes with it and how to care for it. Start with the details that matter to your practice.</p><a href="/pages/engineering#EngineeringLab">Look closer at the design ↗</a></div></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sp-journey sp-pad" id="PhilosophyJourney">
    <header class="sp-section-head"><p class="sp-kicker">03 / OUR JOURNEY</p><h2>A shared idea.<br>A growing world.</h2><p>Making room for movement,<br>one new chapter at a time.</p></header>
    <div class="sp-journey-grid">
      <div class="sp-globe" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 500"><defs><clipPath id="PhilosophyGlobe-{{ section.id }}"><circle cx="250" cy="250" r="210"/></clipPath></defs><g class="sp-globe-grid"><circle cx="250" cy="250" r="210"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="105" ry="210"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="180" ry="210"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="210" ry="85"/><ellipse cx="250" cy="250" rx="210" ry="160"/><path d="M40 250h420M250 40v420"/></g><g clip-path="url(#PhilosophyGlobe-{{ section.id }})" class="sp-globe-route"><path d="M122 170Q262 20 280 145T365 357"/><path d="M365 357Q444 250 355 213" stroke-dasharray="4 7"/></g><g class="sp-world-point" data-sp-region="0"><circle cx="122" cy="170" r="8"/><text x="96" y="148">NORTH AMERICA</text></g><g class="sp-world-point" data-sp-region="1"><circle cx="280" cy="145" r="8"/><text x="275" y="119">EUROPE</text></g><g class="sp-world-point" data-sp-region="2"><circle cx="365" cy="357" r="8"/><text x="278" y="390">AUSTRALIA</text></g><g class="sp-world-point" data-sp-region="3"><circle cx="355" cy="213" r="8"/><text x="370" y="240">ASIA</text></g></svg><span>ONE IDEA. MANY PLACES.</span></div>
      <div class="sp-timeline"><nav aria-label="Explore our brand journey"><button type="button" data-sp-year="0" aria-pressed="true">2022</button><button type="button" data-sp-year="1" aria-pressed="false">2023</button><button type="button" data-sp-year="2" aria-pressed="false">2026</button><button type="button" data-sp-year="3" aria-pressed="false">2027 <small>PLANNED</small></button></nav>
        <div class="sp-year-panel" aria-live="polite"><p class="sp-small" data-sp-year-state>OUR FIRST CHAPTER</p><strong data-sp-year-number>2022</strong><h3 data-sp-year-title>North America.</h3><p data-sp-year-countries>United States · Canada</p><p data-sp-year-copy>The SENSOL journey begins in the United States and Canada.</p></div>
        <p class="sp-small sp-map-note">Illustrated journey, not a geographic map.<br>2027 markets are planned expansion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sp-close sp-pad"><p class="sp-kicker">THE NEXT CHAPTER IS YOURS</p><h2>Find your space.<br><em>Make your move.</em></h2><div><a class="sp-cta" href="/products/sensol-flex-air">Explore FLEX AIR <span>↗</span></a><a class="sp-text-link" href="/pages/engineering">Explore the engineering ↗</a></div></section>
</div>
<script src="{{ 'ssm-philosophy.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
